[00:14.40]1. The stars that fill the summer night
[00:17.70]Look down from above.
[00:21.00]The beauty of the day and night
[00:24.44]You fashioned with love.
[00:27.88]Your hands prepared the land and sea,
[00:31.38]And ev’rything that came to be
[00:35.63]Brought joy to your heart.
[00:41.66](Chorus)
[00:45.99]There is joy in your creation,
[00:50.33]In the message of salvation,
[00:55.39]And the Paradise to come.
[00:57.59]But to have your love forever
[00:59.79]Is a real and lasting treasure.
[01:01.99]You alone will prove to be
[01:17.26]Our joy eternally.
[01:32.54]2. Jehovah, we have all we need
[01:35.52]To bring us delight—
[01:38.49]The things we hear and touch and see
[01:41.74]And feel deep inside.
[01:44.99]You gave us such a perfect start,
[01:48.49]Eternity in ev’ry heart,
[01:51.99]And joy in our lives.
[01:58.84](Chorus)
[02:02.12]There is joy in your creation,
[02:05.39]In the message of salvation,
[02:08.67]And the Paradise to come.
[02:12.48]But to have your love forever
[02:15.88]Is a real and lasting treasure.
[02:19.28]You alone will prove to be
[02:26.28]Our joy eternally.
[02:29.41](Bridge)
[02:32.54]This joy could not be ours
[02:35.68]Without the gift of your Son.
[02:38.81]His sacrifice has paid the price
[02:41.95]So joy could be ours for all time.
[02:47.95](Chorus)
[02:52.95]There is joy in your creation,
[02:58.75]In the message of salvation,
[03:05.23]And the Paradise to come.
[03:12.48]But to have your love forever
[03:15.88]Is a real and lasting treasure.
[03:19.28]You alone will prove to be
[03:26.28]Our joy eternally.
[03:33.02](Chorus)
[03:36.32]There is joy in your creation,
[03:39.62]In the message of salvation,
[03:42.92]And the Paradise to come.
[03:46.22]But to have your love forever
[03:49.53]Is a real and lasting treasure.
[03:53.53]You alone will prove to be
[04:00.53]Our joy eternally.